title: Beetle Nest
portrait left: seeker

A hollow behind the stacks, full of shed carapaces and, at the back, two things that gleam.
Three beetles are asleep in front of them. Lightly.

choice:
  - Fight for the loot -> fight
  - Leave them sleeping -> leave

